+  it('可观测锚:连发 60 次 setItem(模拟拖拽逐帧),防抖窗内零底层写,到期恰 1 次写且是最后一帧', async () => {
+    const backend = makeBackend()
+    const compactAtFlush = vi.fn((s: Slice) => s)
+    const storage = createDebouncedCompactPersistStorage<Slice>({
+      resolveTarget: backend.resolveTarget,
+      readCurrent: backend.readCurrent,
+      compactAtFlush,
+      skipLifecycleListeners: true,
+    })
+
+    for (let frame = 0; frame < 60; frame += 1) {
+      storage.setItem(NAME, storageValue(`tool-${frame}`))
+      vi.advanceTimersByTime(16) // 60fps 帧间隔 < 防抖窗,持续重置
+    }
+    expect(backend.writeCalls).toHaveLength(0) // 拖拽期间零 persist 写
+    expect(compactAtFlush).not.toHaveBeenCalled() // compact 也不在热路径上
+
+    vi.advanceTimersByTime(CANVAS_PERSIST_DEBOUNCE_MS)
+    await storage.flushAndSettle('drain')
+    expect(backend.writeCalls).toHaveLength(1) // 停手后一次写
+    expect(compactAtFlush).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1)
+    const [, written] = backend.writeCalls[0]
+    expect((JSON.parse(written) as { state: Slice }).state.activeTool).toBe('tool-59') // 落的是最后一帧
+  })
+
+  it('envelope 与被替换的 createJSONStorage 逐字节等价({ state, version } 键序/无空白)', async () => {
